.TH ROFI-HUB 1 "rofi-hub 0.2.0" "rofi-hub" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rofi-hub \- keyboard-driven launcher for installed Rofi apps
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rofi-hub
.RI [ PROVIDER ]
.RI [ \-\-theme " MODE" ]
.RI [ \-\-no-theme ]
.br
.B rofi-hub open
.RI [ PROVIDER ]
.br
.B rofi-hub list
.RB [ \-\-json ]
.br
.B rofi-hub theme
.RB [ show | set " MODE" | list | dump ]
.br
.B rofi-hub doctor
.RB [ \-\-json ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rofi-hub
reads provider manifests from the XDG data directories and shows the
installed apps in a Rofi dmenu. Selecting an entry starts the provider's
declared argument vector. The hub never evaluates shell text from a manifest.
.PP
With no subcommand the hub opens the menu, or opens
.I PROVIDER
directly when an id is given.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "\-\-theme " MODE
Use
.I MODE
for this run. Accepted values are
.BR auto ,
.BR nord ,
.B solarized
(alias
.BR light ),
.B gruvbox
(alias
.BR dark ),
or a path to a
.B .rasi
file.
.TP
.B \-\-no-theme
Do not pass a generated theme to Rofi.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B open \fR[\fIPROVIDER\fR]
Open the hub menu, or one provider by id.
.TP
.B list \fR[\fB\-\-json\fR]
List installed providers. With
.B \-\-json
the output is a JSON array with
.BR id ,
.BR name ,
.BR exec ,
.B version ,
and
.B available
fields.
.TP
.B theme show
Print the effective theme and its source.
.TP
.B theme set \fIMODE\fR
Persist a theme choice.
.TP
.B theme list
List the built-in modes.
.TP
.B theme dump
Print the generated Rofi theme for the effective mode.
.TP
.B doctor \fR[\fB\-\-json\fR]
Check Rofi, provider manifests, and theme files. Returns a non-zero status
when a required runtime piece is missing.
.SH MANAGER COMPATIBILITY
The former rofi app manager commands are available as aliases:
.TP
.B launcher
Open Rofi's
.B drun
application launcher. Aliases:
.BR drun ,
.BR apps .
.TP
.B window
Open Rofi's window switcher. Alias:
.BR windows .
.TP
.B calc
Open rofi-calc. Alias:
.BR calculator .
.TP
.B emoji
Open rofi-emoji.
.TP
.B power
Open
.BR rofi-power-menu .
.TP
.BR calendar ", " clipboard ", " keybinds ", " screen-time
Open the matching hub provider directly.
.TP
.BI show " MODE " [ ARGS ...]
Run a raw Rofi mode with the shared config and theme.
.TP
.B network
Open the NetworkManager menu for Wi-Fi scan/connect, saved connections,
Ethernet devices, rescan, and radio toggle. Requires
.BR nmcli (1).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ROFI_BIN
Rofi executable to run. Defaults to
.BR rofi .
.TP
.B ROFI_CONFIG
Explicit Rofi configuration file.
.TP
.B ROFI_THEME
Rofi theme passed through to every app.
.TP
.B ROFI_HUB_THEME
Theme mode passed to provider processes.
.TP
.B ROFI_HUB_THEME_FILE
Generated theme file passed to provider processes.
.TP
.B ROFI_HUB_PROVIDER_DIR
Colon-separated provider manifest directories. Checked before the XDG search
path; useful for development and Nix wrappers.
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Base for
.I rofi-hub/config.toml
and the saved theme.
.TP
.B XDG_DATA_HOME
Base for per-user provider manifests and themes.
.TP
.B XDG_DATA_DIRS
System data directories searched after the user directory. Defaults to
.IR /usr/local/share:/usr/share .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/rofi-hub/config.toml
Optional configuration (prompt, font, default theme).
.TP
.I ~/.config/rofi-hub/theme
Saved theme choice from the menu.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/rofi-hub/providers/*.toml
Per-user provider manifests.
.TP
.I /usr/share/rofi-hub/providers/*.toml
System provider manifests installed by a package.
.TP
.I /usr/share/rofi-hub/themes/hub.rasi
Packaged fallback hub theme.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero on success or when the user cancels the menu. Non-zero when Rofi or a
required provider is missing, or when a manifest cannot be read.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rofi (1),
.BR rofi-calendar (1),
.BR rofi-keybinds (1),
.BR rofi-clipboard (1),
.BR screen-time (1),
.BR rofi-screen-time (1)
